# ❄️ DIN 5008 Project Freeze Protocol

Use this checklist to verify the stability of the application before "freezing" a version.

## 1. Core Integrity (The "Skeleton")

- [ ] **Offline Launch**: Disconnect from the internet. Open `index.html`. Does the application load without errors?
- [ ] **Console check**: Press F12. Are there any red errors in the console? (Ignore harmless warnings).
- [ ] **No 404s**: Ensure no missing CSS or JS files are reported in the Network tab.

## 2. Visual Layout (DIN 5008 Spec)

- [ ] **Sidebar Width**: Is the sidebar fixed at exactly 300px?
- [ ] **Viewport**: Is the A4 sheet centered in the gray area?
- [ ] **Mobile Blocker**: Reduce window width to <1000px. Does the "Desktop Only" overlay appear?
- [ ] **Fold Marks**: Are the fold marks visible on the left edge of the paper?

## 3. Print Engine (Critical)

- [ ] **Print Preview**: Press `Ctrl+P` or click the Print button.
- [ ] **No Sidebar**: The dark sidebar MUST NOT appear on the print preview.
- [ ] **No Placeholders**: Empty fields (like specific address lines) should not show gray placeholder text.
- [ ] **Margins**: The content should sit correctly on the page (no double margins from browser headers).

## 4. Input Logic & Data

- [ ] **Sender Block**: contenteditable fields (Name, Street) accept text.
- [ ] **Back Address (Zone 1)**: Updates automatically when you type in the Sender Block.
- [ ] **Date Field**: Defaults to today's date? Can it be changed?
- [ ] **Local Storage**: Refresh the page. Is your typed text still there?

## 5. UI Interactions

- [ ] **Settings Modal**: Opens when clicking "Einstellungen"?
- [ ] **Layout Switch**: Toggling "Form A" / "Form B" shifts the address window position?
- [ ] **Profile Manager**: Clicking "Absender-Profil" opens the dialog?
- [ ] **Profile Save**: Saving profile data populates the sender block?

## 6. Code "Smell" Test

- [ ] **No Orphans**: Are there any `.ts` or `.json` files left in the root that shouldn't be there?
- [ ] **Spec-IDs**: Do random checks in `index.html`. Do elements have `data-spec` attributes?

